      "revision": 1315308885,
      "text": "Vernicia fordii, usually known as the tung tree and also as the tung-oil or tungoil tree, the kalo nut tree, and the China wood-oil tree, is a species of flowering plant in the spurge family Euphorbiaceae. It is native to southern China, Myanmar, and northern Vietnam."
